  "applies_to": "TROX FSL decentralised (single-room) ventilation units with the FSL-CONTROL II / X-AIRCONTROL controller and the EM-BAC-MOD-01 XAC BACnet MS/TP card.",
  "summary": "FSL-CONTROL II single-room ventilation units connect to BACnet MS/TP through the EM-BAC-MOD-01 XAC expansion card. The PICS in the FSL-CONTROL II manual lists 47 objects (AV 1-18, BV 1-20, MV 1-9): BMS presets for operating mode, occupancy, fan stage, changeover, fire and window inputs, BMS-fed temperatures, humidity and VOC values, plus feedback, alarms and hardware status messages.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": "EM-BAC-MOD-01 XAC 1.0; data point list valid from X-AIRCONTROL V1.14",
  "default_device_instance": "32900 + address switch",
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "Object names, units and state texts come from the EM-BAC-MOD-01 XAC PICS tables; descriptions follow the manual's data point list where it has one.",
    "The data point list gives the same functions for LON and Modbus; only the BACnet objects are listed here.",
    "Temperature defaults of 327.67 mean \"invalid / not set\".",
    "BV 11-17 are the individual hardware messages (power supply, EM-FSLIO, fan, sensor, filter, flow control, damper).",
    "StartPCM, Alarm2, Release, FanForce and RoomTemp_Set are not described in the manual."
  ],
